\"ubd480e8d\"><br />假设模型参数为θ，损失函数为L，小批量大小为B，累积步数为K：</span></p><ol list=\"u64c5273b\"><li fid=\"u33293d71\" data-lake-id=\"u4ec1f085\" id=\"u4ec1f085\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5675ec69\" id=\"u5675ec69\">单步梯度计算</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u29e01184\" id=\"u29e01184\">$$\\frac{\\partial L_k}{\\partial \\theta} = \\frac{1}{B} \\sum_{i=1}^B \\frac{\\partial \\ell(x_i, y_i; \\theta)}{\\partial \\theta} $$</span></li><li fid=\"u33293d71\" data-lake-id=\"uea31c32b\" id=\"uea31c32b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub8ae205b\" id=\"ub8ae205b\">累积过程</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5ce1d334\" id=\"u5ce1d334\"><br />每次迭代计算梯度但不更新参数，累积K次后进行一次参数更新： </span><span data-lake-id=\"u2aa38098\" id=\"u2aa38098\">$$\\theta_{t+1} = \\theta_t - \\eta \\cdot \\frac{1}{K} \\sum_{k=1}^K \\frac{\\partial L_k}{\\partial \\theta} $$</span></li><li fid=\"u33293d71\" data-lake-id=\"u48f226f3\" id=\"u48f226f3\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8a29ab86\" id=\"u8a29ab86\">内存优化机制</span></strong></li></ol><ul list=\"ucd2ca35f\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"ude07dbd5\" data-lake-id=\"ude129a40\" id=\"ude129a40\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaa42f92f\" id=\"uaa42f92f\">传统训练：需存储每个小批次的激活值（如中间层输出）和梯度</span></li><li fid=\"ude07dbd5\" data-lake-id=\"u67e94691\" id=\"u67e94691\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4f90e7f1\" id=\"u4f90e7f1\">梯度累积：仅需存储当前梯度，通过累加减少中间变量存储需求</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"ud486a945\" id=\"ud486a945\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0842cbcb\" id=\"u0842cbcb\">伪代码示例</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E4%BC%A0%E7%BB%9F%E8%AE%AD%E7%BB%83%5Cnfor%20batch%20in%20dataloader%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20loss%20%3D%20model(batch)%5Cn%20%20%20%20loss.backward()%5Cn%20%20%20%20optimizer.step()%5Cn%20%20%20%20optimizer.zero_grad()%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E6%A2%AF%E5%BA%A6%E7%B4%AF%E7%A7%AF%5Cnaccumulated_grad%20%3D%200%5Cnfor%20batch%20in%20dataloader%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20loss%20%3D%20model(batch)%5Cn%20%20%20%20accumulated_grad%20%2B%3D%20loss.grad%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20step%20%25%20accumulation_steps%20%3D%3D%200%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20optimizer.step()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20accumulated_grad.zero_()%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sMgdT%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"block\" name=\"hr\" value=\"data:%7B%22id%22%3A%22xhBuK%22%7D\"></card><h3 data-lake-id=\"a831c76d\" id=\"a831c76d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u34007582\" id=\"u34007582\">2. 显存优化效果分析</span></h3><h4 data-lake-id=\"0bf3a0af\" id=\"0bf3a0af\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue3a48a8f\" id=\"ue3a48a8f\">(1) 内存占用分解</span></h4><table data-lake-id=\"rOARs\" id=\"rOARs\" class=\"lake-table\" style=\"width: 750px\"><colgroup><col width=\"250\"><col width=\"250\"><col width=\"250\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id=\"u97c72288\" id=\"u97c72288\"><td data-lake-id=\"u71e86c41\" id=\"u71e86c41\"><p data-lake-id=\"u0bd5381a\" id=\"u0bd5381a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u42c7ca94\" id=\"u42c7ca94\">内存占用项</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"uc7fc9459\" id=\"uc7fc9459\"><p data-lake-id=\"u44c008fb\" id=\"u44c008fb\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc4c0d546\" id=\"uc4c0d546\">传统训练占比</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ud407239c\" id=\"ud407239c\"><p data-lake-id=\"u4509b1ce\" id=\"u4509b1ce\"><span data-lake-id=\"u735e65d6\" id=\"u735e65d6\">梯度累积优化后</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"ua16a1a2e\" id=\"ua16a1a2e\"><td data-lake-id=\"u4bf82552\" id=\"u4bf82552\"><p data-lake-id=\"u46235f59\" id=\"u46235f59\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5f194118\" id=\"u5f194118\">模型参数</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u50723f0e\" id=\"u50723f0e\"><p data-lake-id=\"u29ea329b\" id=\"u29ea329b\"><spa